      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1777226829122,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Information level reflection\n    - Browsing Behaviour\n    - Response patterns\n    - Engagement signals\n\n\n\n\nStrategy level reflection\n\n- Detecting failure patterns\n    - Rule based triggers\n    - Model based classification\n\n- Generating agent feedback\n    - Strategy suggeestions for the responder agents\n    - Corrective experiences for the planner agent\n\n- Updating the dialogue plan\n\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Information level reflection\n    - Browsing Behaviour\n    - Response patterns\n    - Engagement signals\n\n\n\n\nStrategy level reflection\n\n- Detecting failure patterns\n    - Rule based triggers\n    - Model based classification\n\n- Generating agent feedback\n    - Strategy suggeestions for the responder agents\n    - Corrective experiences for the planner agent\n\n- Updating the dialogue plan\n\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
