      "updated": 1777227786433,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "\nSuccess Rate: This metric captures the completion of the recommendation task. A session is considered successful if the simulated user selects one of the system’s recommended items before the dialogue ends. In agentic terms, this is our goal-completion score.\n\nHit Ratio@K: This measures whether the correct item appeared in the top-K recommendations shown to the user. It reflects the quality of the agent’s reasoning and ranking ability. If the user liked item number 3 and the system ranked it in the top 5, that’s a hit. It shows the system is surfacing relevant options efficiently.\n\nAverage Number of Turns: A measure of efficiency. How many dialogue turns does the system need to reach success? Too few, and it might be rushing. Too many, and it might be dithering or repeating itself. Good agentic systems strike the right balance eliciting enough information without tiring the user.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "\nSuccess Rate: This metric captures the completion of the recommendation task. A session is considered successful if the simulated user selects one of the system’s recommended items before the dialogue ends. In agentic terms, this is our goal-completion score.\n\nHit Ratio@K: This measures whether the correct item appeared in the top-K recommendations shown to the user. It reflects the quality of the agent’s reasoning and ranking ability. If the user liked item number 3 and the system ranked it in the top 5, that’s a hit. It shows the system is surfacing relevant options efficiently.\n\nAverage Number of Turns: A measure of efficiency. How many dialogue turns does the system need to reach success? Too few, and it might be rushing. Too many, and it might be dithering or repeating itself. Good agentic systems strike the right balance eliciting enough information without tiring the user.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
